{"server":"cn","storyId":"act17d0_level_act17d0_02_end","groupId":"act17d0","stageId":"act17d0_02","title":"扩大防守范围","storyCode":"OD-2","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_02_end.txt","sourceHash":"757cb428df9381a1b89de8d666201069a58e4500d554ef379c5aecf3d7c951fa","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_deserttownD"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"停火！小心平民！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"他们跑了，科恩！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"别管了，保护其他人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"来人帮帮忙，这边有人受伤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"先把他们抬进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"医生！你还好吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这儿！我没事！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者镇民","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我的腿！我的腿断了！我的腿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静，你的腿还在，只是脱臼了，咬紧牙关。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者少女","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妈妈......妈妈......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谁看到阿尔加的妈妈了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救命......救......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绷带要不够了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"混账东西，*粗口*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"那边是不是着火了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"那个方向，是镇中心？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"看来不只是这里遭到袭击。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，领主卫队去哪儿了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"别管什么领主卫队了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"到处都是打斗声，事情变麻烦了，我们不能在这里逗留，这里太空旷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"先把那几个伤员抬到建筑后面！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_165","isRemote":false,"text":"怪物！怪物又来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"感染者女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_163","isRemote":false,"text":"救命啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"没完没了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"亚历山大！你去屋顶掩护我们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"来不及了医生，我们必须离开这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是我们能去哪儿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"先去你的诊所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"别管那么多，先让所有人都去你的诊所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"来人搭把手！他走不动了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"库兹，你看看还有没有其他人躲在屋子里，再把这个社区的人都带到诊所去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"注意安全！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......真是一场灾难。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"四十多个人......所有人都在这里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们救下的人......都在这里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"少了多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不少人跑丢了，可能是去了镇子那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是有一些老人......他们来不及......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"别想了，不是你的错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这些怪物，它们是从哪儿来的？它们是训练过的战兽吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道......我以前没见过这种东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"那些暴徒掏出武器的时候，这些怪物就从地里钻出来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"别管它们是从哪儿来的，这些东西也太多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"周围的情况怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"一塌糊涂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"镇子那边有打斗声，我不确定发生了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我们还有多少弹药？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"不多了，我还剩下四个弹匣，如果亚历山大的弹药用完了，我们就麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"弹药问题还不是最要紧的，这间屋子快撑不住了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"凭那怪物的个头，哪怕漏掉一两个，它们都能撞穿这堵墙，我们是守不住的，得想想办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，病人的情况呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不少人受伤了，我只能简单包扎一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"绷带和酒精都不太够了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"有没有办法先离开镇子？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"离开镇子之后要去哪？带着这么多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"没有食物和水，他们跑到荒地上就是寻死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我不觉得这些怪物会放弃袭击我们。到了荒地情况只会更糟，没有掩体，无法藏身，再加上我们都看见了它们的钻地本事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道一个地方......说不定是安全的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇南边有一个很特殊的建筑，可能是镇上最安全的地方，和领主的大宅差不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"详细说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以前有一个叫罗德岛的医疗组织，在镇子边缘租了一块地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"后来他们雇佣了工人，挖了不少土石，在那里修建了很结实的屋子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......说不定是这里最结实的屋子？看着像堡垒一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么知道“罗德岛”会愿意帮助我们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那间屋子只有一个看门人，我认识他，我从他那里买过一些医用补给。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"很多土石，多半是挖了地下室。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来像是雇佣兵的安全屋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"感觉很不可靠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"除非我们有更好的选择，我建议去看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"战车","speakerId":"char_459_tachak","isRemote":false,"text":"没食物没水，守在这个土坯房子里无异于等死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个屋子在镇子边缘，我们可以从镇外过去，这样就不会被其他人看到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"库兹，你的盾牌还能用吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"半面盾，姑且能拿来揍人......应该。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要一个人和我一起去，至少得有人保护医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"还是我去吧，大不了我替医生挡子弹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"别说傻话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我和库兹陪医生去看看那个“安全屋”，蒂娜你留在这里协助亚历山大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜华","speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"医生，接下来无论发生什么，一定要听我指挥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"库兹，保护好医生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"我会罩着他的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"没看到灯光，好像没人？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"先别靠近，这屋子的门被砸开了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"连这里也......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这群暴徒的目的是什么？和强盗土匪一样打砸抢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救......救命......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"救命啊！谁都好！救救我啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我还不想死......可恶......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是那个看门人！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"别动，你留在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_safehouseoutdoorN"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......早知道就不做这份工作了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想死在这......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你是谁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"不要乱动，你的腿断了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"雇......雇佣兵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"别杀我！求求你！我说了我真的不知道钥匙在哪！我只是个看门的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我！我真的不知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"冷静点！我是来帮你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你和那群人不是一伙的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"救救我！救救我啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我说了！冷静点！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"库兹！带医生过来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥克芬先生......你的腿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你......你是那个感染者医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"谢天谢地！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急，让我看看你的腿......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"好家伙，这屋子里被翻了个底朝天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"房子里面比外面看起来要小很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"暗门、隔间、强化外墙，安全屋不都这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"无线电设备？都给砸成这样了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这么大一台，有点复古啊。原来这个世界是有这种通讯设备的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"他们连汽车都有，有无线电也不奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我们之前住的破屋子里还有别的“废旧电器”呢，冰箱、风扇、热水壶......虽然这些损毁物件里没有一个是真正通电的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"就和这个无线电台一样，就和我们之前弄来的车一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"这些机器里都有一个装着黑色结晶的装置，我估计那个就是这些设备的能源。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"痛痛痛！你轻点啊医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忍住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还好，不太严重，骨头没有断。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是这里的负责人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是......罗德岛驻外办公室。我......我其实只是个看门的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"让我猜猜，这些暴徒冲到这里，让你打开地下室的门，但是你坚守职责，一直在装傻，于是被打了一顿，然后他们就把你丢在这里等死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......差不多是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你们怎么知道有地下室的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"你中计了，其实我们是暴徒们的后手，专程来套你的话的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"库兹！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"不要生气，我只是活跃一下气氛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"你们......你们到底是做什么的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别担心，科恩小姐他们是好人，他们一直在保护感染者社区的居民。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者社区也被袭击了？？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这......都乱套了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"领主卫队呢？图拉领主的卫队呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"领主卫队一直没有出现，他们可能也遇到了麻烦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"看门人先生，我们需要你的帮助。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我能帮上什么呢？我现在站都站不起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"得了病的镇民们也被袭击了，感染者社区的人员和建筑都损失惨重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"灰烬","speakerId":"char_456_ash","isRemote":false,"text":"我们需要你打开安全屋，让他们躲在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"这......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"闪击","speakerId":"char_457_blitz","isRemote":false,"text":"相对的，我们也会保护你的安全，你可以信任我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"依据我和罗德岛签订的合同，整个安全屋都是罗德岛的资产。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没有权力......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉......感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥克芬","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"让他们来吧，丢了工作总比丢了命强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米亚罗","speakerId":"avg_npc_160_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你！奥克芬先生！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_456_ash","aliases":["灰烬"]},{"speakerId":"char_457_blitz","aliases":["闪击"]},{"speakerId":"char_458_rfrost","aliases":["霜华"]},{"speakerId":"char_459_tachak","aliases":["战车"]}]}
